@VSHelpDesk.WebAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5154

### Health
GET {{VSHelpDesk.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### UC-001 Login (Hafta 1)
POST {{VSHelpDesk.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "support",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!"
}

### Current user (Hafta 1)
GET {{VSHelpDesk.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tickets list (Hafta 3)
GET {{VSHelpDesk.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Process incoming emails job (Hafta 2)
POST {{VSHelpDesk.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/process-incoming-emails
X-Jobs-Api-Key: dev-jobs-api-key-change-me

### Resolve inactive tickets job (Hafta 4)
POST {{VSHelpDesk.WebAPI_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/resolve-inactive-tickets
X-Jobs-Api-Key: dev-jobs-api-key-change-me
